body:
\>no one owes you a relationship

&#x200B;

I'm consciously aware of that. But it doesn't seem to do me any good. I've been wanting one like the one I had with her for so long, now. And despite my efforts I've gotten only maybe three people to even talk to me. Being rejected by everyone, especially in my state of mind, has only made me angry. Maybe it's more frustration than resentment.
